$$
30 - 2 = 28
$$

Jean wants to package these 28 lollipops into bags, with each bag containing 2 lollipops. To find the number of bags, divide the total remaining lollipops by the number per bag:

$$
28 \div 2 = 14
$$

Thus, Jean can fill $\boxed{14}$ bags.  
